<p>Callback Tracker and Callback24 are practical CallPage alternatives for businesses that primarily need website visitors to request a phone call. Brightcall, formerly Convolo, deserves a look when routing new form leads to sales representatives is the main job. Leadoo fits a broader website-conversion project, while CloudTalk addresses missed calls inside a phone operation. Twilio is an option for a team willing to build its own callback service. Keep CallPage if its current routing, scheduling and call allowance already fit. Compare the complete journey from request to answered conversation, including failed attempts, country coverage and follow-up ownership.</p>
<h2>A callback request is not the same as a missed call</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.callpage.io/">CallPage</a> lets a website visitor request an immediate or scheduled callback, and also offers routing, virtual phone and meeting-scheduling capabilities. A replacement should handle the operation you actually use. A phone system that retries an unanswered incoming call may be useful, but does not automatically replace the popup that collects a visitor's number before they call you.</p>
<p>Keep CallPage when the widget is already generating requests that your team can answer and its CRM handoff works. Its <a href="https://www.callpage.io/pricing">current plans</a> separate successful-call allowances, users, operators and domains. Essentials includes up to 50 successful calls monthly; Pro includes up to 100. Additional capacity and the AI voice offering can affect the total bill. A trial is available, but it is not a permanent free plan.</p>
<p>Reasons to switch include a different country mix, a need to route existing forms, a larger telephone-support operation or a simpler widget requirement. Do not assume another vendor's call quota is equivalent: minutes, attempts and successfully connected calls measure different things. CallPage's definition refers to a call answered by both parties and lasting longer than ten seconds; check how the competing service bills the same conversation.</p>
<p>This guide compares official product and pricing information checked on October 14, 2026. Recommendations are editorial judgments, not results from firsthand trials. Older lists often recommend LiveCall, but its <a href="https://www.callpage.io/livecall-tool">official destination now directs customers to CallPage</a>. It is therefore excluded as an independent alternative. Convolo is represented under its current Brightcall name.</p>
<h2>Six candidates with different scopes</h2>
